# Patched Plaything: only a cast from the hand counts, and the cast belongs to the object that was cast. Bot1 casts the Plaything
# (a 2/1 with its two -1/-1 counters), Bolts it the same turn, and Reanimates it: the card that returns is a new object (CR 400.7)
# that was not cast, so it enters as a full 4/3 with no counters. Bot1 loses 3 life to Reanimate.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Patched Plaything
Lightning Bolt
Reanimate
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

